    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like \"getting through today\" is a lie. it's just delaying the inevitable. i look at the future and i don't see any peace, just more of this same struggle. honestly, sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and finally be at peace is to just... stop trying. to just let go of the struggle entirely. does that even make sense? like, is there actually any point in struggling if the outcome is always gonna be this much pain?",
